WEBVTT

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:04.770
<i>Wealth, fame, power...</i>

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:06.670
<i>Gold Roger,
the King of the Pirates,</i>

00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:08.970
<i>attained everything
this world has to offer.</i>

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:12.840
<i>The words he uttered just before
his death drove people to the seas.</i>

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:16.680
<i>My treasure? If you want it,
you can have it!</i>

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>Find it! I left everything
this world has to offer there!</i>

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:27.590
<i>And so men head for the Grand Line
in pursuit of their dreams!</i>

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:31.490
<i>The world has truly entered
a Great Pirate Era!</i>

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:36.870
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:42.770
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:44.100
<i>ONE PIECE!</i>

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:54.620
<i>Compasses only cause delays</i>

00:00:54.620 --> 00:01:00.360
<i>Delirious with fever,
I take the helm</i>

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:10.350
<i>If the dusty treasure map has
been verified, it's not a legend!</i>

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:18.170
<i>When it comes to personal storms,</i>

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:23.480
<i>simply ride aboard
someone else's biorhythm</i>

00:01:23.480 --> 00:01:27.150
<i>and pretend it isn't there!</i>

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:32.650
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:38.360
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:44.600
<i>A coin in my pocket,
and do you wanna be my friend?</i>

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:49.970
<i>We are, We are on the cruise!</i>

00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:51.040
<i>We are!</i>

00:01:54.540 --> 00:01:56.710
<i>Please, leave the ship, Sanji-san.</i>

00:01:56.710 --> 00:01:59.050
I don't want to kill you.

00:01:59.050 --> 00:02:00.380
No way!

00:02:00.380 --> 00:02:03.840
Pearl... Cymbals!

00:02:08.990 --> 00:02:14.160
I took everything away
from that damn geezer...

00:02:14.160 --> 00:02:17.330
So that I could live...

00:02:17.330 --> 00:02:19.670
His power...

00:02:19.670 --> 00:02:21.660
His dream...

00:02:32.010 --> 00:02:36.020
This restaurant is
that geezer's treasure!

00:02:36.020 --> 00:02:40.560
I... I can't repay the damn
geezer for his kindness

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:44.490
unless I risk my life for him too!

00:02:44.490 --> 00:02:46.700
Gum-Gum...

00:02:46.700 --> 00:02:49.530
Stop it! Keep your hands off of them!

00:02:49.530 --> 00:02:53.400
Battle-Axe!!

00:03:01.310 --> 00:03:06.810
<i>"Coolheaded, Coldhearted Demon.
Pirate Fleet Chief Commander Ghin."</i>

00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:26.230
The fin's been smashed!!

00:03:30.340 --> 00:03:34.180
How dare that brat do such a thing?

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:36.510
Is he trying to destroy the ship?!

00:03:36.510 --> 00:03:41.520
Ghin! Blow Zeff's brain out!

00:03:41.520 --> 00:03:43.020
Do it already!

00:03:43.020 --> 00:03:49.520
B-but he saved our lives
by giving us 100 meals!

00:03:50.860 --> 00:03:53.700
--Ghin, you son of a bitch!
--Hey!

00:03:53.700 --> 00:03:58.200
I didn't really attack
you guys or anything...

00:03:58.200 --> 00:04:01.300
I only broke the fin.

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:04.310
Hey, chore boy!
What do you think you're doing?!

00:04:04.310 --> 00:04:07.640
--I'll sink it.
--What?!

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:10.010
I'll sink this ship.

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:15.320
That ain't funny!

00:04:15.320 --> 00:04:19.150
I was wondering how you'd explain that...
Are you crazy, you damn bastard?!

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:22.660
If I destroy the ship,
there'll be no reason for them to attack.

00:04:22.660 --> 00:04:24.320
What?!

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:27.760
What do you know?
What do you know about

00:04:27.760 --> 00:04:29.630
the significance of
the kindness I received?

00:04:29.630 --> 00:04:32.000
What do you know
about this restaurant?!

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:36.000
So you're gonna die for the restaurant?
Are you stupid or something?

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:37.670
What'd you say?!

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:39.440
Dying isn't...

00:04:39.440 --> 00:04:42.840
Dying isn't something you
should do to repay kindness!!

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:46.180
That's not what he saved you for!

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:51.020
Being given life and yet dying...
is something that a weakling would do!

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:54.850
Then is there any other way
to settle this matter?!

00:05:00.700 --> 00:05:04.300
Now, now, you guys... Stop fighting.

00:05:04.300 --> 00:05:08.470
It's simply disgraceful for you to fight
among yourselves after all this.

00:05:08.470 --> 00:05:12.970
You can't do any more reckless things
while the hostage is with us anyway.

00:05:12.970 --> 00:05:18.540
It was unfortunate for you guys to have
the Krieg Pirates as your opponent.

00:05:22.150 --> 00:05:27.420
Burn to death with my Fire Pearls!

00:05:33.830 --> 00:05:35.490
Huh?

00:05:42.840 --> 00:05:47.840
<i>--Ghin!
--Why... Ghin-san?</i>

00:05:47.840 --> 00:05:51.640
Sorry, Pearl. Out of my way...

00:05:56.020 --> 00:05:59.350
Ghin! Are you going to betray us?!

00:05:59.350 --> 00:06:05.960
I'm sorry, Don Krieg.
He saved our lives.

00:06:05.960 --> 00:06:13.300
I don't want him to die this way.
At least... At least...

00:06:13.300 --> 00:06:17.030
please let me bury him with my hands.

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:26.620
Have you lost your mind,
Pirate Fleet Chief Battle Commander?

00:06:26.820 --> 00:06:28.650
Are you all right, Owner?

00:06:28.650 --> 00:06:31.650
Owner! Please hang in there!

00:06:31.650 --> 00:06:33.990
Chief Battle Commander?

00:06:33.990 --> 00:06:36.990
Then he wasn't an underling?

00:06:36.990 --> 00:06:42.300
To think that he cracked that shield
guy's shield... How powerful...

00:06:44.170 --> 00:06:48.000
See? It worked great...
my plan to lure him out...

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:52.340
Liar! You really were going to
break the ship, weren't you?!

00:06:52.340 --> 00:06:54.340
<i>--Sanji-san!
--What?!</i>

00:06:54.340 --> 00:06:57.180
I wanted you to leave this ship unhurt,

00:06:57.180 --> 00:07:00.250
but it looks like that's
not gonna happen.

00:07:00.250 --> 00:07:02.280
You got that right.

00:07:02.280 --> 00:07:07.290
I can't let you have this restaurant
even if it means risking my life.

00:07:07.290 --> 00:07:10.290
Then, at least burying you
with my own hands is...

00:07:10.290 --> 00:07:13.300
my way of settling this matter.

00:07:13.300 --> 00:07:17.800
Hmph! Thanks. To hell with you!

00:07:17.800 --> 00:07:19.970
You too, Straw Hat.

00:07:19.970 --> 00:07:25.270
Well... I won't lose
against weaklings like you.

00:07:27.310 --> 00:07:28.640
You bastard!

00:07:28.640 --> 00:07:31.310
What did you just say
to our Chief Commander?!

00:07:31.310 --> 00:07:34.650
"To hell with you"? "Weaklings"?
How dare you run your mouth like that!

00:07:34.650 --> 00:07:40.320
We're the Krieg Pirates,
the strongest pirates in the East Blue!

00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:44.520
Wasn't it just because you had
the biggest number of pirates?

00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:53.000
Oh, boy... You struck at
the heart of the matter...

00:07:53.000 --> 00:07:54.670
So I was right...

00:07:54.670 --> 00:07:57.840
--You son of a bitch!!
--I'm gonna kill you!!
--Stop mocking us!!

00:07:57.840 --> 00:07:59.670
Back off!!

00:07:59.670 --> 00:08:01.280
Don Krieg!

00:08:01.280 --> 00:08:03.610
But...

00:08:03.610 --> 00:08:10.290
If you get upset when called weak,
that just proves that you are weak.

00:08:10.290 --> 00:08:13.460
The result will decide
if you're strong or weak.

00:08:13.460 --> 00:08:17.790
You've got me. Don't get so worked up!

00:08:17.790 --> 00:08:20.130
Y-yes, sir!

00:08:20.130 --> 00:08:21.960
Ghin!

00:08:21.960 --> 00:08:25.630
Finishing off that cook
is your responsibility.

00:08:25.630 --> 00:08:30.970
I'll take care of that
naive idiot over there...

00:08:30.970 --> 00:08:34.570
Understood, Don Krieg.

00:08:36.640 --> 00:08:38.980
--Hey, brat!
--Hm?

00:08:38.980 --> 00:08:46.650
I'll make you fully experience the true
power that conquered the East Blue.

00:08:46.650 --> 00:08:53.750
I'll teach you that your devil fruit
or whatever it is means nothing.

00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:58.670
All your griping's getting annoying....

00:08:58.670 --> 00:09:02.270
I'll kick your ass. It's as simple as that.

00:09:02.270 --> 00:09:08.280
I'm coming over now.
You just wait there!

00:09:08.280 --> 00:09:10.340
What impudence...

00:09:21.960 --> 00:09:25.460
--This is it for that cook.
--That's right.

00:09:25.460 --> 00:09:30.360
<i>When Ghin-san holds that weapon
in his hands, it means he's serious.</i>

00:09:37.470 --> 00:09:41.480
His nickname is... Demon...

00:09:41.480 --> 00:09:43.980
It doesn't matter if his enemy
is crying or screaming,

00:09:43.980 --> 00:09:46.650
he tortures him to death mercilessly.

00:09:46.650 --> 00:09:50.180
He's a demon who doesn't
have a shred of sympathy...

00:09:53.990 --> 00:09:58.330
<i>I'm sorry, Sanji-san,
but you can't defeat me.</i>

00:09:58.330 --> 00:10:02.130
Just keep saying that, you small fry.

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:08.660
Here I come!

00:10:23.020 --> 00:10:25.650
You son of a...

00:10:31.290 --> 00:10:33.230
Sanji!

00:10:37.700 --> 00:10:43.000
I warned you...
that you can't defeat me...

00:10:47.210 --> 00:10:49.380
See you...

00:10:49.380 --> 00:10:52.970
Just accept your defeat!

00:10:57.390 --> 00:10:59.390
Yeah! Our Chief Commander
is really incredible!

00:10:59.390 --> 00:11:01.320
<i>Crush him, Ghin-san!</i>

00:11:01.320 --> 00:11:04.880
--Sanji!
--Sanji! Come on!!

00:11:09.330 --> 00:11:11.530
Die!

00:11:59.880 --> 00:12:03.320
<i>That cook landed a blow on Ghin-san...</i>

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:07.320
<i>Don't tell me Ghin-san
is gonna be defeated, too...</i>

00:12:07.320 --> 00:12:09.660
You fools...

00:12:09.660 --> 00:12:14.330
What have you seen with
your own eyes all this time?

00:12:14.330 --> 00:12:18.000
Ghin is a coolheaded demon
whom I put my trust in.

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:22.670
That's exactly why I appointed
him as the Chief Commander.

00:12:22.670 --> 00:12:25.440
He'll show his true colors soon.

00:12:30.010 --> 00:12:32.180
Is Sanji really okay?

00:12:32.180 --> 00:12:35.650
Of course he isn't! Combining
the attacks from that shield guy,

00:12:35.650 --> 00:12:39.520
he must have at least 5-6 broken ribs.

00:12:39.520 --> 00:12:46.690
Those skewered dumplings...
aren't as good... as I thought.

00:12:46.690 --> 00:12:51.430
Is that the best
the Chief Commander can do?

00:13:00.040 --> 00:13:03.650
Hm? What's he doing? Is this any time
to be paying attention to others?

00:13:03.650 --> 00:13:05.310
Ah-ha!

00:13:05.310 --> 00:13:08.980
All right! I'll kick his ass
while I have an opening!

00:13:08.980 --> 00:13:10.820
Hm?

00:13:15.820 --> 00:13:18.190
Don't overexert yourself.

00:13:19.990 --> 00:13:21.660
Huh?

00:13:32.840 --> 00:13:37.010
You bastard!!
Do you really intend to fight me?!

00:13:37.010 --> 00:13:40.850
Intend to fight you?
I don't need to do such a thing.

00:13:40.850 --> 00:13:44.690
What's needed is
a means to kill. That's all.

00:13:44.690 --> 00:13:50.360
And that's the force that humans have.
Remember it, you damn monkey!

00:13:50.360 --> 00:13:55.700
What?! If you take a monkey
lightly, it'll scratch you!

00:14:00.370 --> 00:14:02.270
Sanji!

00:14:10.810 --> 00:14:13.980
All right! His bones
are shattered by now!

00:14:13.980 --> 00:14:15.980
Get him!

00:14:15.980 --> 00:14:18.820
Dammit! If only he hadn't taken
the damage from the shield guy...

00:14:18.820 --> 00:14:23.160
He's taken at least 10 hits
of those iron balls by now...

00:14:26.660 --> 00:14:32.400
You really do whatever you want...
you small fry!

00:14:39.010 --> 00:14:43.880
<i>Damn... He's really strong...</i>

00:14:46.680 --> 00:14:48.680
I'll finish you off now!

00:14:48.680 --> 00:14:51.120
Don't struggle any more...

00:14:53.820 --> 00:14:56.690
What was that?! Pity?

00:14:57.860 --> 00:15:00.700
Don't underestimate me!

00:15:00.700 --> 00:15:03.320
<i>Ah! Ghin-san!</i>

00:15:06.300 --> 00:15:08.100
Sanji!

00:15:10.640 --> 00:15:12.140
Ah! Sanji!

00:15:12.140 --> 00:15:18.310
Oh, no! He can no longer bear even
the shock from his own attacks...

00:15:32.660 --> 00:15:37.060
<i>--All right!
--That's our Ghin-san!</i>

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:45.070
You... damn... bastard...

00:16:08.800 --> 00:16:11.300
I can't...

00:16:11.300 --> 00:16:17.430
I can't... Don Krieg...

00:16:20.640 --> 00:16:24.310
--Huh?
--I can't...

00:16:25.310 --> 00:16:30.080
I can't do it, Don Krieg!!

00:16:32.990 --> 00:16:34.990
Ghin...

00:16:34.990 --> 00:16:40.660
I can't... kill this man...

00:16:40.660 --> 00:16:43.000
What'd you say?!

00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:51.510
It was... it was the first time for me...

00:16:51.510 --> 00:16:55.680
Even when I'm down and out,
I won't take charity from others.

00:16:55.680 --> 00:16:57.850
Take this food away now!

00:16:57.850 --> 00:17:00.580
Stop whining and eat it already!

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:04.290
To me, anyone who's
hungry is a customer.

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:07.960
Sorry, but I'm not a customer.

00:17:07.960 --> 00:17:13.290
I can understand how a hungry
person feels more than anyone.

00:17:13.290 --> 00:17:15.800
You can die for your pride if you want,

00:17:15.800 --> 00:17:20.390
but if you eat and survive,
don't you think there's a future for you?

00:17:26.310 --> 00:17:28.980
Sorry...

00:17:28.980 --> 00:17:35.970
Sorry... Thank you... I thought I'd die.
I thought I was done...

00:17:36.980 --> 00:17:44.990
Delicious... Delicious...
I've never eaten food so delicious.

00:17:44.990 --> 00:17:47.690
It's damn delicious, isn't it?

00:17:53.500 --> 00:17:58.840
Sorry... You're gonna get yelled at,
because you fed me free, right?

00:17:58.840 --> 00:18:02.610
There's no proof, so there's no
reason for me to be yelled at.

00:18:06.280 --> 00:18:13.450
No one had treated me
so kindly before...

00:18:13.450 --> 00:18:18.790
So I can't... kill this man!

00:18:18.790 --> 00:18:21.290
Come back any time!

00:18:22.800 --> 00:18:28.640
I know... I don't intend to betray you.

00:18:28.640 --> 00:18:32.640
I don't think what we've done up until
now is wrong or anything, either...

00:18:32.640 --> 00:18:37.650
I still respect your power
and I appreciate you as well.

00:18:37.650 --> 00:18:41.250
I was really happy when you
put your trust in my strength

00:18:41.250 --> 00:18:43.650
and appointed me as
the Chief Commander.

00:18:43.650 --> 00:18:49.660
So I've followed your orders
and I will from here on as well...

00:18:49.660 --> 00:18:52.830
But... But...

00:18:52.830 --> 00:18:56.860
I can't kill... just this one person!

00:19:03.270 --> 00:19:08.940
Don Krieg... If circumstances allow...
is there any way...

00:19:08.940 --> 00:19:13.280
is there any way you'd let this ship...
this restaurant off the hook...

00:19:13.280 --> 00:19:15.280
You son of a bitch!

00:19:15.280 --> 00:19:17.590
As if defying my orders wasn't enough,

00:19:17.590 --> 00:19:21.550
now you're giving me a lecture?!
What's the meaning of this craziness?!

00:19:23.620 --> 00:19:26.630
How disappointing...

00:19:26.630 --> 00:19:32.970
Morality... Sympathy...
I hate those kinds of things the most.

00:19:32.970 --> 00:19:35.840
Didn't I always say that?!

00:19:37.300 --> 00:19:40.800
Move away, guys...

00:19:41.980 --> 00:19:44.410
Don! That's...

00:19:45.980 --> 00:19:48.820
M... MH5!

00:19:48.820 --> 00:19:51.320
That's the strongest
poison gas weapon!

00:19:51.320 --> 00:19:53.320
--What?!
--Poison gas?!

00:19:53.320 --> 00:19:56.090
--Ahh! Mask!
--Put the mask on!
--Hurry up!

00:19:56.090 --> 00:19:59.990
--We'll be killed, too!
--To use a weapon like that...
--That's despicable, you bastard!

00:19:59.990 --> 00:20:02.830
Do you know what's gonna
happen when you use that?!

00:20:02.830 --> 00:20:09.840
Stop whining about stupid stuff,
you fools! This is a battle!

00:20:09.840 --> 00:20:13.170
Winning is the only goal.

00:20:13.170 --> 00:20:18.010
Foul play? Dirty?
What's wrong with that?!

00:20:18.010 --> 00:20:19.810
Might makes right.

00:20:19.810 --> 00:20:23.180
No matter what means we take,
the result is everything.

00:20:23.180 --> 00:20:28.020
Using poison gas or whatever...
Winning is all that matters.

00:20:29.020 --> 00:20:31.960
That's power.

00:20:34.030 --> 00:20:36.620
What a horrible bastard...

00:20:41.700 --> 00:20:46.370
Throw that gas mask away!

00:20:46.370 --> 00:20:51.050
You're no longer one of us.

00:20:51.050 --> 00:20:53.040
Die!

00:20:59.390 --> 00:21:02.660
I won't let you shoot poison gas!

00:21:02.660 --> 00:21:06.620
Stop scampering about, anchor boy!

00:21:18.340 --> 00:21:21.010
D-dammit!

00:21:21.010 --> 00:21:26.510
Ghin! You don't have to listen
to what that weakling says!

00:21:26.510 --> 00:21:30.020
I'm gonna kick his ass now!

00:21:30.020 --> 00:21:33.520
Don't mock Don Krieg!

00:21:33.520 --> 00:21:38.190
He's the strongest man.
You can't defeat him.

00:21:38.190 --> 00:21:43.360
Come to your senses, you idiot!
That man is trying to kill you!

00:21:43.360 --> 00:21:45.370
I deserve it...

00:21:45.370 --> 00:21:52.040
since I couldn't fulfill my role,
shamelessly losing to emotion...

00:21:52.040 --> 00:21:57.380
This is...
This is a well-deserved punishment!

00:21:57.380 --> 00:22:01.050
--Ghin!
--Why... Why?

00:22:01.050 --> 00:22:06.650
Ha! So you showed your pride
at the end... But it's too late.

00:22:06.650 --> 00:22:10.320
Die together with that cook!

00:22:10.320 --> 00:22:15.890
Deadly Poison Gas Bomb... M... H... 5!

00:22:23.000 --> 00:22:24.340
Dive into the sea!!

00:22:24.340 --> 00:22:26.970
Owner! Get inside the restaurant!!

00:22:29.840 --> 00:22:31.510
Let me borrow those.

00:22:31.510 --> 00:22:33.680
Sanji! Ghin! Use these!

00:22:33.680 --> 00:22:36.680
--Chore boy!
--Now for mine!

00:22:36.680 --> 00:22:40.590
Ahh! Everyone dived into the sea!

00:22:43.520 --> 00:22:47.090
Oh, boy... Oh, boy... Oh, boy...

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:06.070
<i>When I was little, I had
a vision of a treasure map</i>

00:23:10.280 --> 00:23:17.220
<i>and I always searched
for that miraculous place</i>

00:23:17.220 --> 00:23:24.390
<i>before someone else could
beat me to it</i>

00:23:27.000 --> 00:23:37.000
<i>If the world is going to change</i>

00:23:38.480 --> 00:23:45.490
<i>before I can even attain my dream</i>

00:23:45.490 --> 00:23:52.560
<i>then take me to the time
when I knew nothing</i>

00:23:52.560 --> 00:24:02.560
<i>so that my memories won't fade</i>
